This archive lists the hamham development log by year. Open the [current devlog]($link.page('devlog/2026')) for the latest updates, or [subscribe via RSS]($link.alternative('rss')).

Looking for a player introduction? Browse the [WHAM! BAM! HAM-HAM! Player Guide]($link.page('guides')), including [match rules]($link.page('guides/getting-started')), [Heroes]($link.page('guides/hero-cards')), and [collection guides]($link.page('guides/collection-binder')).
